			<div class="container">
				<h1 class="page-title">
					<span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Issuer Disclosure</span>

				</h1>
				
						<div class="field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>ESMA's work in the area of issuer disclosure aims at providing investors with adequate information on the companies they invest in, thereby ensuring better investor protection.&nbsp;</p>
<p>ESMA’s work on issuer disclosure is carried out by the&nbsp;<a href="/about-esma/governance-structure/standing-committees#IssuersStandingCommittee-ISC"><strong>Issuers Standing Committee (ISC)</strong></a>, which is supported by several permanent working groups and a number of task forces and project teams. Additionally, the ISC draws on the expertise of external stakeholder representatives through its&nbsp;<a href="/about-esma/governance-structure/standing-committees"><strong>Consultative Working Groups</strong></a>.</p>
</div>
			
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="main-content">
			<div class="container">
				<article class="node node--type-esma-page node--view-mode-full">
					
			<div class="field field--name-field-page-paragraph field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
													<div id="11608" class="field_item text-group white_background">
			<div class="paragraph paragraph--type--paragraph-esma-page-body paragraph--view-mode--default">
									
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h3><strong>Corporate Reporting</strong></h3>
</div>
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-paragraph-background-color field--type-list-string field--label-hidden field__item">white_background</div>
      
							</div>
		</div>
	
